📣 PHP security releases are scheduled for Thursday, 19 November 2026, 14:00–14:30 UTC, as part of our regular four-week release cycle.

All supported PHP versions are affected. Highest severity: CRITICAL. Issues at this severity require non-default configuration or uncommon setups.

Please prepare to upgrade promptly once the releases are available.

